   - `$table->string('email')->unique();`: Adds an email column that is unique and indexed.
   - `$table->timestamp('email_verified_at')->nullable();`: Adds a nullable timestamp indicating when the email was verified.
   - `$table->string('password');`: Adds a password column.
   - `$table->rememberToken();`: Adds a token for authentication purposes.
   - `$table->timestamps();`: Adds timestamps for creation and update.
3. **Foreign Key Constraint**: 
